After one pass of Bubble Sort, the largest element (25) 'bubbles up' to the last position. The array becomes:
`{10, 5, 15, 20, 25}`.

Steps:
Compare 15 & 10 → swap → {10, 15, 5, 25, 20}
Compare 15 & 5 → swap → {10, 5, 15, 25, 20}
Compare 15 & 25 → no swap
Compare 25 & 20 → swap → {10, 5, 15, 20, 25}

